(7372161, 1156095, 114285, '<td valign="top">Who doesn''t love a picture of a child enjoying themselves in the rain....this is classic pure beauty and wonder,  the essence of real joy that children can have  with such simple things,  this is my top pick,  and if it doesn''t get the blue then you''ve been ripped off!!!</td>', 'Who doesn''t love a picture of a child enjoying themselves in the rain....this is classic pure beauty and wonder,  the essence of real joy that children can have  with such simple things,  this is my top pick,  and if it doesn''t get the blue then you''ve been ripped off!!!', '2015-06-24 21:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7372162, 1156302, 114285, '<td valign="top">I''m just wondering how many takes you would''ve had to do to get this right, and how much damage to her eyes did she succumb to.</td>', 'I''m just wondering how many takes you would''ve had to do to get this right, and how much damage to her eyes did she succumb to.', '2015-06-24 21:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
