(7372251, 1156621, 33068, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite shot of the challenge but I''m struggling with it being pastel.  My first impression of the image is, WOW!  what beautiful VIBRANT SATURATED colors. I want to give this a 10 but will give a 7 for now for not meeting the challenge in my eyes.  I may change my mind later though. Regardless, this a stunner.</td>', 'This is my favorite shot of the challenge but I''m struggling with it being pastel.  My first impression of the image is, WOW!  what beautiful VIBRANT SATURATED colors. I want to give this a 10 but will give a 7 for now for not meeting the challenge in my eyes.  I may change my mind later though. Regardless, this a stunner.', '2015-06-25 00:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
