(7373859, 1156193, 115814, '<td valign="top">I''m enjoying being part of the DPL <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1296711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">"First 10"</a> side challenge. Yours is photo #6 in my random voting stream for the Pastels III Challenge. <br/> <br/>Yep. This one is terrific. I''m only at #6 in viewing this challenge set, but I suspect this will hold up well as I work through the rest. My top pick for now. I''ll be back later.</td>', 'I''m enjoying being part of the DPL "First 10" side challenge. Yours is photo #6 in my random voting stream for the Pastels III Challenge.  Yep. This one is terrific. I''m only at #6 in viewing this challenge set, but I suspect this will hold up well as I work through the rest. My top pick for now. I''ll be back later.', '2015-06-26 22:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373860, 1156630, 115814, '<td valign="top">The colors are so powerful in this, I wouldn''t normally consider them pastel, but the longer I look, the more the softer shades stand out. This is lovely, well-balanced. Delicate intensity. Here''s some bling in appreciation.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1153350" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/115814/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153350.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/115814/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153350.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/115814/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153350.jpg"/></a></td>', 'The colors are so powerful in this, I wouldn''t normally consider them pastel, but the longer I look, the more the softer shades stand out. This is lovely, well-balanced. Delicate intensity. Here''s some bling in appreciation. ', '2015-06-26 22:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373861, 1155308, 115814, '<td valign="top">This is among my top picks for the challenge. I tend to be drawn to this kind of abstract in any case, but here the initial impact of the colors and the implied movement is great. Hope it does well. Here''s some bling in appreciation:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1153350" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/115814/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153350.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/115814/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153350.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/115814/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153350.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is among my top picks for the challenge. I tend to be drawn to this kind of abstract in any case, but here the initial impact of the colors and the implied movement is great. Hope it does well. Here''s some bling in appreciation: ', '2015-06-26 22:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373965, 1156505, 115814, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah. This is awesome. I saw a grungy station wagon of a similar vintage while shooting pastels and tried to follow it  in hopes of getting a shot. No luck. Now I''m glad, because this one would put anything I might have done to shame. Love the title and the tableau for this. By the way, I think there may be a small piece of an errant third grader''s bike paint on the right rear bumper. Hope this does well!</td>', 'Oh yeah. This is awesome. I saw a grungy station wagon of a similar vintage while shooting pastels and tried to follow it  in hopes of getting a shot. No luck. Now I''m glad, because this one would put anything I might have done to shame. Love the title and the tableau for this. By the way, I think there may be a small piece of an errant third grader''s bike paint on the right rear bumper. Hope this does well!', '2015-06-27 02:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373967, 1154905, 115814, '<td valign="top">What an intriguing combination of styles here. Clever. Whimsical. Nicely done.</td>', 'What an intriguing combination of styles here. Clever. Whimsical. Nicely done.', '2015-06-27 02:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
