(7373970, 1155050, 115814, '<td valign="top">I''m enjoying being part of the DPL <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1296711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">"First 10"</a> side challenge. Yours is photo #2 in my random voting stream for the Pastels III Challenge. <br/> <br/>A lovely moment and attractive color palette. Oh, for a bit more of the eyes.</td>', 'I''m enjoying being part of the DPL "First 10" side challenge. Yours is photo #2 in my random voting stream for the Pastels III Challenge.  A lovely moment and attractive color palette. Oh, for a bit more of the eyes.', '2015-06-27 02:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373971, 1156455, 115814, '<td valign="top">I''m enjoying being part of the DPL <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1296711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">"First 10"</a> side challenge. Yours is photo #3 in my random voting stream for the Pastels III Challenge. <br/> <br/>Pastels - for sure. Bridesmaids - a stretch. Three a possible miscount. Lovely nonetheless and I think there''s a fight for the flower. Seriously, I''m not a big droplet fan, but this is different enough to hold my attention for longer than a sidelong glance.</td>', 'I''m enjoying being part of the DPL "First 10" side challenge. Yours is photo #3 in my random voting stream for the Pastels III Challenge.  Pastels - for sure. Bridesmaids - a stretch. Three a possible miscount. Lovely nonetheless and I think there''s a fight for the flower. Seriously, I''m not a big droplet fan, but this is different enough to hold my attention for longer than a sidelong glance.', '2015-06-27 02:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373972, 1156255, 115814, '<td valign="top">I''m enjoying being part of the DPL <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1296711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">"First 10"</a> side challenge. Yours is photo #7 in my random voting stream for the Pastels III Challenge. <br/> <br/>This appeals to my geometric predilections. Well put together but not sure why... and that''s fine with me.</td>', 'I''m enjoying being part of the DPL "First 10" side challenge. Yours is photo #7 in my random voting stream for the Pastels III Challenge.  This appeals to my geometric predilections. Well put together but not sure why... and that''s fine with me.', '2015-06-27 02:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373973, 1155350, 115814, '<td valign="top">I''m enjoying being part of the DPL <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1296711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">"First 10"</a> side challenge. Yours is photo #8 in my random voting stream for the Pastels III Challenge. <br/> <br/>A careful set-up. Well lighted to pastelly-ness and beyond. Add pristine reflection and voila! Seriously, the lighting control is really impressive and way beyond my capability. Nice execution.</td>', 'I''m enjoying being part of the DPL "First 10" side challenge. Yours is photo #8 in my random voting stream for the Pastels III Challenge.  A careful set-up. Well lighted to pastelly-ness and beyond. Add pristine reflection and voila! Seriously, the lighting control is really impressive and way beyond my capability. Nice execution.', '2015-06-27 02:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373974, 1156462, 115814, '<td valign="top">Engaging abstract, eye catching and attention holding. Not quite sure about the balance from upper left to lower right with the significant lower right emptiness contrasted with the maelstrom of color at upper left. Still compelling.</td>', 'Engaging abstract, eye catching and attention holding. Not quite sure about the balance from upper left to lower right with the significant lower right emptiness contrasted with the maelstrom of color at upper left. Still compelling.', '2015-06-27 02:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
