(7375010, 1156558, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lots of smokey skies in my area right now too. Hope you''re not in immediate danger from the fire(s).<br/> <br/>The composition of this one is so-so. There''s not really a clear subject, and the lens flare behind the palm (palmetto?) fronds, coupled with your sharpening (I''m guessing) makes for some odd splotchiness.<br/> <br/>Perhaps if you''d moved to the right to fill more of the frame with the leaves, it wouldn''t feel so much like a naked expanse on the left?</td>', 'Lots of smokey skies in my area right now too. Hope you''re not in immediate danger from the fire(s). The composition of this one is so-so. There''s not really a clear subject, and the lens flare behind the palm (palmetto?) fronds, coupled with your sharpening (I''m guessing) makes for some odd splotchiness. Perhaps if you''d moved to the right to fill more of the frame with the leaves, it wouldn''t feel so much like a naked expanse on the left?', '2015-06-28 16:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375012, 1156432, 62249, '<td valign="top">Sometimes the out-of-focus background helps an image, and sometimes it hurts. In this image, it does both. The leaves on the left are interesting. But the pink splotch behind and slightly above the flower detracts.</td>', 'Sometimes the out-of-focus background helps an image, and sometimes it hurts. In this image, it does both. The leaves on the left are interesting. But the pink splotch behind and slightly above the flower detracts.', '2015-06-28 16:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375013, 1155299, 62249, '<td valign="top">The balloons could have potentially been a good choice of subject. The composition isn''t particularly interesting, nor is the background. End the dark edge in the upper right corner could''ve been cropped out.</td>', 'The balloons could have potentially been a good choice of subject. The composition isn''t particularly interesting, nor is the background. End the dark edge in the upper right corner could''ve been cropped out.', '2015-06-28 16:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375014, 1156585, 62249, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised at your choice of color cards, only one or two of which contain color swatches that fit my idea of pastel. Nevertheless, the idea is good. Your processing left splotchy areas along the right edge.</td>', 'I''m surprised at your choice of color cards, only one or two of which contain color swatches that fit my idea of pastel. Nevertheless, the idea is good. Your processing left splotchy areas along the right edge.', '2015-06-28 16:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375015, 1155538, 62249, '<td valign="top">An interesting portrait. I like the textures and the horizontal repetition. The pinkness of the image seems artificially introduced to shoehorn the shot into the challenge. But it''s still a good photo.</td>', 'An interesting portrait. I like the textures and the horizontal repetition. The pinkness of the image seems artificially introduced to shoehorn the shot into the challenge. But it''s still a good photo.', '2015-06-28 16:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375017, 1155308, 62249, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Love how the title helps tell the story, but it''s an interesting abstract on its own. Only comment is that the upper left corner (the sun, I assume) is still a tiny bit too bright given the balance of tonality in the rest of the image. And there''s a tiny dark speck in the purplish band on one of the pier supports.</td>', 'Very cool. Love how the title helps tell the story, but it''s an interesting abstract on its own. Only comment is that the upper left corner (the sun, I assume) is still a tiny bit too bright given the balance of tonality in the rest of the image. And there''s a tiny dark speck in the purplish band on one of the pier supports.', '2015-06-28 16:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375018, 1156099, 62249, '<td valign="top">Good concept, good composition, good use of DOF. Lighting is harsh, and saturation could''ve been backed off a bit. FWIW, I don''t think many of those lipsticks are a pastel shade... (and yes, I''m a woman).</td>', 'Good concept, good composition, good use of DOF. Lighting is harsh, and saturation could''ve been backed off a bit. FWIW, I don''t think many of those lipsticks are a pastel shade... (and yes, I''m a woman).', '2015-06-28 16:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375021, 1155992, 62249, '<td valign="top">A different crop--one eliminating the blurred blue bit in the lower right corner-- might''ve strengthened this image. Good choice of a pastel subject. The flowers are cute. Title needs work :-).</td>', 'A different crop--one eliminating the blurred blue bit in the lower right corner-- might''ve strengthened this image. Good choice of a pastel subject. The flowers are cute. Title needs work :-).', '2015-06-28 16:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375022, 1156559, 62249, '<td valign="top">Not quite in sharp focus, and too contrasty.</td>', 'Not quite in sharp focus, and too contrasty.', '2015-06-28 16:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375023, 1156489, 62249, '<td valign="top">Wish focus were a little sharper and you had cloned out the splotch in the sky a bit to the right of and slightly lower than the model''s finger. That said, I like the color palette and the composition of this image.</td>', 'Wish focus were a little sharper and you had cloned out the splotch in the sky a bit to the right of and slightly lower than the model''s finger. That said, I like the color palette and the composition of this image.', '2015-06-28 16:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375024, 1156404, 62249, '<td valign="top">Not pastel. But is compositionally interesting, and the graininess works with this image.</td>', 'Not pastel. But is compositionally interesting, and the graininess works with this image.', '2015-06-28 17:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375025, 1156216, 62249, '<td valign="top">The white vignette looks too gimmicky, and the processing left a lot of visible banding in the transition zone from the vignette to the image.</td>', 'The white vignette looks too gimmicky, and the processing left a lot of visible banding in the transition zone from the vignette to the image.', '2015-06-28 17:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375027, 1155556, 62249, '<td valign="top">Like the composition. Perhaps lighten the dark pink area in the foreground in the lower right corner of the frame.</td>', 'Like the composition. Perhaps lighten the dark pink area in the foreground in the lower right corner of the frame.', '2015-06-28 17:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375034, 1156427, 62249, '<td valign="top">The blurry DOF almost works. It''s just at odds with the sharp texture along the narrow in-focust band along the surface the flower is sitting on. Lighting is flat. Unattractive halo along top edge of uppermost petal. Unattractive dark splotches at left edge of the frame and just to the right o the tulip about midway vertically.</td>', 'The blurry DOF almost works. It''s just at odds with the sharp texture along the narrow in-focust band along the surface the flower is sitting on. Lighting is flat. Unattractive halo along top edge of uppermost petal. Unattractive dark splotches at left edge of the frame and just to the right o the tulip about midway vertically.', '2015-06-28 17:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375039, 1154832, 62249, '<td valign="top">A good concept, and a well-chosen day given the nice clouds. There''s an odd left/right split in the look of the shote. It looks as if in processing the image you added warmth to the right half of the frame and didn''t do the same to the left half. Or even desaturated the left. In any case, it''s still an attractive image.</td>', 'A good concept, and a well-chosen day given the nice clouds. There''s an odd left/right split in the look of the shote. It looks as if in processing the image you added warmth to the right half of the frame and didn''t do the same to the left half. Or even desaturated the left. In any case, it''s still an attractive image.', '2015-06-28 17:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375044, 1156105, 62249, '<td valign="top">This image has so much potential. Normally, I''d consider this type of processing to be overdone, but it works very well on this shot. The only drawbacks are the too-prominent OOF bits of stuff in the lower left corner and swooshing in front of the foreground.</td>', 'This image has so much potential. Normally, I''d consider this type of processing to be overdone, but it works very well on this shot. The only drawbacks are the too-prominent OOF bits of stuff in the lower left corner and swooshing in front of the foreground.', '2015-06-28 17:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375045, 1156243, 62249, '<td valign="top">Tells a story nicely. Background in upper right corner hints that you''ve applied a tad too much magenta in processing.</td>', 'Tells a story nicely. Background in upper right corner hints that you''ve applied a tad too much magenta in processing.', '2015-06-28 17:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375047, 1156083, 62249, '<td valign="top">Petunias from the Munsters'' garden? (See https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Munsters if unfamiliar with the Munsters). Funny, but not truly pastel.</td>', 'Petunias from the Munsters'' garden? (See https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Munsters if unfamiliar with the Munsters). Funny, but not truly pastel.', '2015-06-28 17:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375052, 1154984, 62249, '<td valign="top">Could''ve benefitted from a bit of spotting to remove a few dark specks on the wall. Borderline DNMC, but I still like the shot.</td>', 'Could''ve benefitted from a bit of spotting to remove a few dark specks on the wall. Borderline DNMC, but I still like the shot.', '2015-06-28 17:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375054, 1156621, 62249, '<td valign="top">A fun photo (but I bet the cleanup wasn''t fun!). Like many people, I wouldn''t consider those to be pastel colors, but it''s a good image.</td>', 'A fun photo (but I bet the cleanup wasn''t fun!). Like many people, I wouldn''t consider those to be pastel colors, but it''s a good image.', '2015-06-28 17:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375057, 1156601, 62249, '<td valign="top">Yay! Finally an image that really demonstrates the concept of pastel! This is lovely. My top pick so far. Good composition, lovely bokeh, and truly a pastel palette.</td>', 'Yay! Finally an image that really demonstrates the concept of pastel! This is lovely. My top pick so far. Good composition, lovely bokeh, and truly a pastel palette.', '2015-06-28 17:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375059, 1156293, 62249, '<td valign="top">Cute stuffed animals. Lighting is flat and uninteresting, and background is very busy.</td>', 'Cute stuffed animals. Lighting is flat and uninteresting, and background is very busy.', '2015-06-28 17:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375062, 1156047, 62249, '<td valign="top">Shadows are interesting. Title is at odds with the image, since the fork clearly isn''t in a garden.</td>', 'Shadows are interesting. Title is at odds with the image, since the fork clearly isn''t in a garden.', '2015-06-28 17:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375064, 1156487, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lips, lipstick, and nails are definitely pastel. Person''s skin looks rather yellow. Did you check your white balance?</td>', 'Lips, lipstick, and nails are definitely pastel. Person''s skin looks rather yellow. Did you check your white balance?', '2015-06-28 17:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375068, 1156271, 62249, '<td valign="top">Pretty flowers. Good background. Needs a title.</td>', 'Pretty flowers. Good background. Needs a title.', '2015-06-28 17:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375069, 1156057, 62249, '<td valign="top">Processing rendered the clouds green....</td>', 'Processing rendered the clouds green....', '2015-06-28 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7375071, 1155268, 62249, '<td valign="top">Foreground and mid ground look good. Upper band of gray across top of image isn''t good. You needed a larger placemat or tablecloth (whatever it is the doily is sitting on).</td>', 'Foreground and mid ground look good. Upper band of gray across top of image isn''t good. You needed a larger placemat or tablecloth (whatever it is the doily is sitting on).', '2015-06-28 17:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375072, 1156527, 62249, '<td valign="top">Not exactly pastel, but lovely nonetheless.</td>', 'Not exactly pastel, but lovely nonetheless.', '2015-06-28 17:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375074, 1156095, 62249, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Love how herded is in sharp focus yet you''ve also captured just the right amount of motion blur in her leg and in the rain. Left edge of the image is too blown out, so maybe a tighter crop could''ve helped eliminate that.</td>', 'Very cute. Love how herded is in sharp focus yet you''ve also captured just the right amount of motion blur in her leg and in the rain. Left edge of the image is too blown out, so maybe a tighter crop could''ve helped eliminate that.', '2015-06-28 17:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375076, 1156275, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lighting is harsh and contrasty.</td>', 'Lighting is harsh and contrasty.', '2015-06-28 17:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375077, 1156627, 62249, '<td valign="top">The dark corners are a distraction but otherwise it''s a good shot.</td>', 'The dark corners are a distraction but otherwise it''s a good shot.', '2015-06-28 17:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375079, 1156529, 62249, '<td valign="top">The lighting makes these look bronze or greenish.</td>', 'The lighting makes these look bronze or greenish.', '2015-06-28 17:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375086, 1155544, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lighting and composition are uninteresting and focus seems soft except along the lower left edge of dead flower.</td>', 'Lighting and composition are uninteresting and focus seems soft except along the lower left edge of dead flower.', '2015-06-28 17:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375094, 1156204, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nicely silhouetted foreground, but I suspect most people wouldn''t consider this a pastel image.</td>', 'Nicely silhouetted foreground, but I suspect most people wouldn''t consider this a pastel image.', '2015-06-28 17:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375098, 1156267, 62249, '<td valign="top">Cute capture of the girls. Focus isn''t quite sharp, and the colors are mostly vibrant and highly saturated, not pastel.</td>', 'Cute capture of the girls. Focus isn''t quite sharp, and the colors are mostly vibrant and highly saturated, not pastel.', '2015-06-28 17:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375105, 1156467, 62249, '<td valign="top">Not pastel colors. These are vivid, saturated colors. Processing has resulted in some odd-looking halos along top edges of some of the candies.</td>', 'Not pastel colors. These are vivid, saturated colors. Processing has resulted in some odd-looking halos along top edges of some of the candies.', '2015-06-28 17:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375108, 1156283, 62249, '<td valign="top">Not pastel colors, but a very fun shot nonetheless. The white hotspots on the left sides of the droplets maybe could''ve been touched up.</td>', 'Not pastel colors, but a very fun shot nonetheless. The white hotspots on the left sides of the droplets maybe could''ve been touched up.', '2015-06-28 17:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375111, 1156472, 62249, '<td valign="top">Harsh lighting. The composition doesn''t indicate to viewers what the real subject of the photo is.</td>', 'Harsh lighting. The composition doesn''t indicate to viewers what the real subject of the photo is.', '2015-06-28 17:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375112, 1155788, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like the painterly feel of this.</td>', 'I like the painterly feel of this.', '2015-06-28 17:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375114, 1155816, 62249, '<td valign="top">An odd choice for the challenge, but I like it.</td>', 'An odd choice for the challenge, but I like it.', '2015-06-28 17:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375117, 1156575, 62249, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. Good tonal range. Not exactly pastel.</td>', 'Excellent composition. Good tonal range. Not exactly pastel.', '2015-06-28 17:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375120, 1156630, 62249, '<td valign="top">Ursula''s work? Lovely.</td>', 'Ursula''s work? Lovely.', '2015-06-28 17:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375138, 1156122, 62249, '<td valign="top">Vignette is overdone but I like the action of the toddler and the textured look of the processing.</td>', 'Vignette is overdone but I like the action of the toddler and the textured look of the processing.', '2015-06-28 18:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375142, 1156591, 62249, '<td valign="top">Great title! Good image, too.</td>', 'Great title! Good image, too.', '2015-06-28 18:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375147, 1154905, 62249, '<td valign="top">Wow. A <i>very</i> different take on the challenge but quite creative and undeniably interesting. To me, it''s DNMC for pastels (even the colors on the billboard are mostly saturated &amp; vibrant), but it''s a great image. Gotta ponder how I''m gonna score this...</td>', 'Wow. A very different take on the challenge but quite creative and undeniably interesting. To me, it''s DNMC for pastels (even the colors on the billboard are mostly saturated & vibrant), but it''s a great image. Gotta ponder how I''m gonna score this...', '2015-06-28 18:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375160, 1156066, 62249, '<td valign="top">Not pastel, but a great image.</td>', 'Not pastel, but a great image.', '2015-06-28 18:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375172, 1156297, 62249, '<td valign="top">Wish you''d removed the spots in the upper right corner. The clouds are gorgeous.</td>', 'Wish you''d removed the spots in the upper right corner. The clouds are gorgeous.', '2015-06-28 18:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375175, 1156375, 62249, '<td valign="top">Weird but interesting. Hotspots along right edges of the antlers on the left deer are distracting, as is splotch in lower right corner.</td>', 'Weird but interesting. Hotspots along right edges of the antlers on the left deer are distracting, as is splotch in lower right corner.', '2015-06-28 18:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
