(7378939, 1156147, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club....<br/> <br/>This shot to me does not scream pastels. That being said, I am sure that your score suffered from the DNMC voters. Now on to the pic. The actual pic itself I think is good. I like what you did with the lighting. I am going to have to give that a try sometime. For this shot I like that the vase is centered and that the background is pitch black. I really do like this shot....just not in this challenge. Happy shooting.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club.... This shot to me does not scream pastels. That being said, I am sure that your score suffered from the DNMC voters. Now on to the pic. The actual pic itself I think is good. I like what you did with the lighting. I am going to have to give that a try sometime. For this shot I like that the vase is centered and that the background is pitch black. I really do like this shot....just not in this challenge. Happy shooting.', '2015-07-01 10:02:25.000000', NULL, 0),
