(7379006, 1154947, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>Nice shot. Fits in well with this challenge. The flowers have nice "pastel" colors. Pretty good for being color blind. I think you should have done better in the challenge. The only thing I see that may have hurt your score is there is part of the bottom flower that seems to be out of focus / blurry. Anyway overall nice shot. Happy shooting</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... Nice shot. Fits in well with this challenge. The flowers have nice "pastel" colors. Pretty good for being color blind. I think you should have done better in the challenge. The only thing I see that may have hurt your score is there is part of the bottom flower that seems to be out of focus / blurry. Anyway overall nice shot. Happy shooting', '2015-07-01 11:24:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7379015, 1156278, 29011, '<td valign="top">Thanks for everyone''s comments. I was chasing the light for a few days. Most amazing skies the last evening before rollover but alas I was commuting that evening. Very little contrast was adjusted here. What you see is what you get, well other than the long in camera exposure to smooth out the water. Cheers!</td>', 'Thanks for everyone''s comments. I was chasing the light for a few days. Most amazing skies the last evening before rollover but alas I was commuting that evening. Very little contrast was adjusted here. What you see is what you get, well other than the long in camera exposure to smooth out the water. Cheers!', '2015-07-01 11:29:47.000000', NULL, 0),
